OL,3,GNEWSABouncers praised after football
OL,4,Adisorder in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetermined to "shed a positive light on
OL,7,Fthe day", the manager of The Goose pub,
OL,8,Flocated near the scene, shared a photo
OL,9,Fof their bouncers on Facebook.
